WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.008 --> 00:00:15.760
Jemima swam across the pond.

2
00:00:15.761 --> 00:00:19.593
She quacked at the ducklings.

3
00:00:19.594 --> 00:00:24.394
"Follow me!" Jemima said.

4
00:00:24.395 --> 00:00:30.535
Jemima's duckling followed her.

5
00:00:30.536 --> 00:00:34.442
But Dora's ducklings did not.

6
00:00:34.443 --> 00:00:37.859
The ducklings swam in the reeds.

7
00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:46.595
The ducklings dived under lily pads.

8
00:00:46.596 --> 00:00:50.987
The ducklings played with the frogs.

9
00:00:50.988 --> 00:01:00.434
"Ugh!" Jemima said.

10
00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:06.048
At last Jemima had all the ducklings.

11
00:01:06.049 --> 00:01:08.459
She tried to count them.

12
00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:11.803
"One, two, three . . .

13
00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:14.326
No, two . . ."

14
00:01:14.327 --> 00:01:23.952
The ducklings kept swimming away!

15
00:01:23.953 --> 00:01:31.938
Finally everyone got out of the pond.

16
00:01:31.939 --> 00:01:36.966
"Whew!" Jemima said.

17
00:01:36.967 --> 00:01:40.789
"Hi, Jemima!" Dora called.

18
00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:44.099
She was back from the shop.

19
00:01:44.100 --> 00:02:00.888
"Thank you for watching my babies."

20
00:02:00.889 --> 00:02:03.747
Jemima shook water from her feathers.

21
00:02:03.748 --> 00:02:13.302
She flapped her wings.

22
00:02:13.303 --> 00:02:16.784
"Poor Dora," Jemima said.

23
00:02:16.785 --> 00:02:23.843
"Five ducklings is too many babies!"

24
00:02:23.844 --> 00:02:26.831
Jemima waddled away.

25
00:02:26.832 --> 00:02:35.448
And one perfect duckling followed.
